What is the CALMS Model?

The CALMS Model is a framework that defines the key pillars of a successful DevOps implementation.

CALMS stands for:

C – Culture
A – Automation
L – Lean
M – Measurement
S – Sharing

Think of CALMS as the foundation of DevOps. Even if you use the best tools, DevOps won't succeed without these five principles.

