Key Takeaways
Culture is the foundation—tools alone don't create DevOps.
Automation improves speed, consistency, and reliability.
Lean encourages small, incremental improvements.
Measurement provides data to drive decisions.
Sharing helps teams learn, standardize, and continuously improve.
